        "content": "<p>dsecurity49 edited <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14237\">PR #14237</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Fixes #5198</p>\n<p>Add the missing ISLE lowering rule for <code>bitselect</code> on <code>i128</code> on AArch64, using 64-bit register pair bitwise operations (<code>and</code>, <code>bic</code>, <code>orr</code>). Includes a clif filetest.</p>\n</blockquote>",
